{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"forEachComponentSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reading"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"rType1"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"writing"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"wType1"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Span"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s11MutableSpanV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MutableSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":">) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads 1 and writes 1 component type: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" receives a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":" of the read type and an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MutableSpan"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the written type. Within one call all spans have the same count and the same order: element "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"type":"text","text":" of every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"span belongs to the same member. The batches visit every member exactly once, in the iteration order of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"family."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["movers.forEachComponentSpan(reading: Velocity.self, writing: Position.self) { velocities, positions in","    for i in positions.indices { positions[i].x += velocities[i].dx }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Batches","text":"Batches"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sparse-set storage keeps every component type in its own dense array, so the components of the members of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"family are not necessarily next to each other in all arrays. The spans view the storage itself and nothing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copied or allocated, so a batch is a maximal run of members whose components are consecutive in every involved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array. Entities that were created together and never had components removed form one big batch; after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"churn (removing components swap-removes) the batches get shorter, down to 1 element per call in the worst case."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Write "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" so that it is correct for any batch size, and do not rely on the number of calls."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The archetype storage keeps the columns of a table aligned, so it passes exactly one batch per table that matches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the family and has members, in table creation order. Entities with the same component set form one batch, however"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the component set came about, and a family whose members have several component sets gets several calls."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Rules","text":"Rules"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every type must be a required component of the family. The spans cannot escape "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~Escapable"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"While the pass runs the nexus is locked like in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": structural changes, reading a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written type through the nexus, writing a type twice, and writing a type that is read (or reading a written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type) stop the process with a message."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A delegate subscribed to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" receives one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" per written type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and call, not one event per batch."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(N) where N is the number of members, plus one hash lookup per component type.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEachComponentSpan(reading:writing:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Iterates the members of this family in batches, giving "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" the components of a batch as contiguous spans."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"forEachComponentSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reading"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"R1","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"text":"writing","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Span","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s11MutableSpanV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MutableSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":">) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"}],"title":"forEachComponentSpan(reading:writing:_:)","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"symbolKind":"method","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS6FamilyV20forEachComponentSpan7reading7writing_yqd__m_qd_0_mys0G0Vyqd__G_s07MutableG0Vyqd_0_GztKXEtKAA0F0Rd__AaMRd_0_r0_lF","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"each C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/family\/foreachcomponentspan(reading:writing:_:)"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/NexusEventMask/valueChanges":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Changes of component values: "},{"isActive"